# Sovereign Okinec Ahau's trigger counts creatures you control only. Turn 3: Bot1 crews Smuggler's Copter (3/3, base power 3) with Memnite
# and gives it Giant Growth; Okinec attacks and the crewed Copter, a creature at power 6 over base 3, gets three +1/+1 counters. Turn 5: the
# Copter is no longer crewed - an artifact that is not a creature, and so with no power or toughness at all though it has three +1/+1
# counters (CR 208.3, 301.7a): Okinec's next attack puts no counters on it, so it stays at three (a Vehicle is a creature only while
# crewed). Okinec itself is at its base power both times.

